\label{sec: system_model}
This paper uses bold fonts to represent a vector or a set and light characters for scalars. The \ith element of a set $\boldsymbol{S}$ is denoted as $\boldsymbol{S}(i)$. 
We may use sub- and super-scripts to distinguish notations, such as $q_j^n$.
