\section{Experiment Compute Resources}
We implement our proposed framework as an agentic LLM system using \texttt{GPT-4o-mini} using OpenAI's official API. 
Generating the final hypothesis via the \emph{HHS} optimization process—converging to the final local optimum at hierarchy level 5—typically involves several hundred or even to a thousand iterative search steps.


\section{Limitation}
While \emph{HHS} consistently discovers higher-quality local optima compared to baseline methods, it does not guarantee convergence to the global optimum. Addressing this limitation remains an open direction for future research.


