\title{A Differentiable Distance Metric for Robotics Through Generalized Alternating Projection}

\author{
Vinicius M. Gonçalves,\quad
Shiqing Wei,\quad
Eduardo Malacarne S. de Souza,\quad\\
Krishnamurthy Prashanth,\quad
Anthony Tzes,\quad
and Farshad Khorrami
