Thus, this grouping strategy ensures that UAVs within the same group exhibit similar proximities to the BSs, while UAVs in different groups display distinct distance ranges. By aligning the training objectives with the distinct roles and responsibilities of UAVs in network tasks, this approach enables the development of customized training strategies. 

