\min_{\substack{m_{[K]}, \bm{u}_{[K]}^{[T]}}} 
& \quad 
\sum_{k=0}^K \int_{0}^{T} c\bigl(m_k,\;\bm{x}_k^t,\;\bm{u}_k^t\bigr) dt
