\end{theorem}

Then, \Cref{lem:local-functional-inequalities} follows almost immediately from a combination of \Cref{thm:HS-route-via-congestion,thm:log-Sob-HS-route-via-congestion,thm:effective-trans-flow}, utilizing the  marginal lower bound $\phi=\Omega\left(\frac{\lambda}{(1+\lambda\Delta)^2}\right)$ known for monomer-dimer distributions. 
